  "下载": "Download",
  "复制图片": "Copy image",
  "识别图片里的文字并翻译成你选择的语言，译文按识别到的位置盖在原图上。 可以先框选区域只翻译这些位置，也能把结果下载或复制成新图片。": "Recognize text in images and translate it into your chosen language, with translations overlaid on the original image at the detected positions. You can first select an area to translate only those parts, and also download or copy the result as a new image.",
  "背景": "Background",
  "相近色": "Similar color",
  "深色半透明": "Dark semi-transparent",
  "白色": "White",
  "黑色": "Black",
