  "翻译成": "Translate to",
  "翻译时遇到还没下载的语言包，会提示到这里下载；翻译面板、PDF 和双语阅读页的语言下拉只列出已下载的语言。": "If a language pack hasn't been downloaded yet when translating, you'll be prompted to download it here; the language dropdowns in the translation panel, PDF, and bilingual reading page only list downloaded languages.",
  "只能翻译文字：用本机翻译时，图片翻译和点词换说法不会出现。长段落和专业内容的译文质量不如大模型。": "Text translation only: with on-device translation, image translation and click-word rephrasing are unavailable. Translation quality for long paragraphs and specialized content is lower than with large models.",
