  "翻译整个网站会消耗较多用量": "Translating a whole website uses a lot of credits or API quota",
  "开启后，这个网站的页面都会自动翻译，直到你关闭。当前使用「$1」，网页文字多，会消耗较多点数或 API 用量。": "Once enabled, pages on this website will be translated automatically until you turn it off. Currently using \"$1\"; pages with lots of text will consume more credits or API usage.",
  "改用本机翻译免费，文字也不离开本机，但译文较直白。以后可以在设置里为整站翻译单独选择平台。": "Switching to on-device translation is free and text never leaves your device, but translations are more literal. You can later choose a separate platform for whole-site translation in settings.",
  "以后可以在设置里为整站翻译单独选择平台。": "You can later choose a separate platform for whole-site translation in settings.",
  "继续使用$1": "Continue using $1",
  "改用本机翻译": "Switch to on-device translation",
  "整站翻译": "Whole-site translation",
  "在网页空白处右键，选「翻译这个网站」，这个网站的页面都会自动翻译成目标语言，直到再次点它取消勾选。 只翻译滚动到的内容，相同的文字只翻译一次。": "Right-click on an empty area of the page and select \"Translate this website\"; pages on this website will be translated automatically into your target language until you click it again to uncheck it. Only content you scroll to is translated, and identical text is translated only once.",
  "整站翻译使用的平台": "Platform used for whole-site translation",
  "网页文字多，用点数或自己的 API Key 会消耗较多用量；本机翻译免费，文字也不离开本机。": "Pages with lots of text will consume more credits or your own API Key usage; on-device translation is free and text never leaves your device.",
