  "没有识别到人声": "No speech detected",
  "字幕已准备好，共 $1 句": "Subtitles ready, $1 lines in total",
  "视频翻译中断了，请重新右键视频再试": "Video translation was interrupted. Please right-click the video and try again",
  "视频翻译": "Video translation",
  "在网页视频上右键，选「翻译这个视频」：扩展把整个视频文件取下来识别语音，再整篇翻成双语字幕，跟着播放显示。 只支持能直接下载的短视频文件（10 分钟、100 MB 以内，如 9GAG）；YouTube 这类分段串流播放的视频没法整份取下。": "Right-click on a video on a web page and select \"Translate this video\": the extension downloads the entire video file, recognizes the speech, then translates the whole thing into bilingual subtitles that display in sync with playback. Only short video files that can be downloaded directly are supported (under 10 minutes and 100 MB, such as 9GAG); videos played as segmented streams like YouTube cannot be downloaded in full.",
  "本机识别不会自动判断语种，需要按视频选好。": "On-device recognition does not detect the language automatically; you need to select it for each video.",
  "截取标签页的声音边播边识别，用于没法整份取下的视频。实验功能，完成度很低：语音识别、断句和译文都可能出错，也可能出现字幕长时间不出、页面卡顿或视频声音异常。默认关闭；开启后，右键这类视频选「翻译这个视频」会改用实时字幕，扩展图标里也会出现入口。谨慎开启。": "Captures the tab's audio and recognizes speech as it plays, for videos that cannot be downloaded in full. Experimental feature, very incomplete: speech recognition, sentence segmentation, and translations may all be wrong, and subtitles may fail to appear for long periods, the page may lag, or the video audio may become abnormal. Off by default; when enabled, right-clicking such a video and selecting \"Translate this video\" will switch to live subtitles, and an entry will also appear in the extension icon. Enable with caution.",
  "播放器拦掉了右键的话，点扩展图标里的「视频实时字幕」。": "If the player blocks right-clicking, click \"Video live subtitles\" in the extension icon.",
  "实时字幕改用云端识别": "Use cloud recognition for live subtitles",
  "不用下载语言包，但视频的声音会发给浏览器的语音识别服务：Chrome 使用 Google，Microsoft Edge 使用 Microsoft Azure。只影响实时字幕。": "No language pack download needed, but the video's audio will be sent to the browser's speech recognition service: Google for Chrome, Microsoft Azure for Microsoft Edge. Only affects live subtitles.",
  "翻译平台是 ChatGPT：视频的声音发给 OpenAI 识别（whisper-1，按 OpenAI 的价格计费），会自动判断语种，几秒就能识别完。": "The translation platform is ChatGPT: the video's audio is sent to OpenAI for recognition (whisper-1, billed at OpenAI's rates). The language is detected automatically, and recognition takes just a few seconds.",
  "视频的声音在本机识别，不离开浏览器；识别要花和视频一样长的时间，并要先下载对应语言的离线语言包。翻译平台选 ChatGPT（自带 Key）时改由 OpenAI 识别。": "The video's audio is recognized on this device and never leaves the browser. Recognition takes as long as the video and requires first downloading the offline language pack for that language. If the translation platform is set to ChatGPT (with your own Key), OpenAI handles recognition instead.",
  "当前浏览器不支持设备端语音识别。可以把翻译平台换成 ChatGPT（自带 Key），由 OpenAI 识别。": "This browser doesn't support on-device speech recognition. You can switch the translation platform to ChatGPT (with your own Key) to have OpenAI handle recognition.",
  "这台设备不支持该语言的离线识别。翻译平台选 ChatGPT（自带 Key）时改由 OpenAI 识别。": "This device doesn't support offline recognition for this language. If the translation platform is set to ChatGPT (with your own Key), OpenAI handles recognition instead.",
  "全部字幕（$1 句）": "All subtitles ($1 lines)",
  "字幕已准备好：边播边显示，也可以点「全部字幕」直接看": "Subtitles are ready: they display as the video plays, or click \"All subtitles\" to view them directly",
