  "在网页视频上右键，选「翻译这个视频」。翻好的视频和字幕只存在这个浏览器里，不上传，最多留最近 30 个。": "Right-click a video on a webpage and select \"Translate this video\". Translated videos and subtitles are stored only in this browser, never uploaded, and only the 30 most recent are kept.",
